      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Summary Disclaimer</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed">
        All tools and calculators on ToolsOfTools are provided strictly for educational, informational, and personal computational convenience. Calculations run locally in your web browser and do not constitute financial, investment, legal, tax, medical, or engineering advice. Always cross-verify critical computations with certified professionals.
