      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-4 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-850">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#0D47A1] dark:text-sky-300">Financial & Tax Calculators</h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Calculations regarding EMI, SIP, compound interest, mortgage amortizations, GST, and capital returns represent numerical projections based on fixed variables. They do not constitute licensed financial advisory, accounting, or tax counsel. Actual loan terms, investment yields, and tax liabilities may differ based on institutional policies and statutory revisions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-4 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-850">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#0D47A1] dark:text-sky-300">Health & Fitness Calculators</h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Tools such as BMI, calorie expenditure, body fat percentage, and pace estimators use generalized population formulas (e.g., WHO standards, Harris-Benedict equation). They are not clinical diagnostic tools and should never substitute professional medical advice, clinical evaluations, or prescribed treatments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-4 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-850">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#0D47A1] dark:text-sky-300">Engineering & Construction Tools</h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Calculators for concrete volumes, pipe weights, and material stresses are intended for preliminary volumetric estimation only. Certified civil, mechanical, or structural engineers must independently stamp and verify all architectural and industrial specifications.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-4 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-850">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#0D47A1] dark:text-sky-300">Entertainment & Astrology Tools</h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Tools categorized under entertainment, astrology, or numerology (e.g., Mulank, Bhagyank, friendship calculators) are provided solely for amusement and cultural interest. They possess no scientific or predictive validity.
